### Create a note
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/notes
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Backend practice","body":"Finish the CRUD lesson"}

### List notes
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/notes

### Read the first note
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/notes/1

### Partial update
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/notes/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Updated title"}

### Delete note
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/notes/1
